 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Lovely. Set up a little table with blanket underneath each place card, and dig out any rough patches. Sure, thing. Made on Friday, still warm and smelly. Pasta, a sandwich, and a piece of fruit. Something simple so hands don't get cold. Sure, toss a frisbee, have a game of catch, anything that gets people moving around. He' lead the songs, you act as back up singers. Keep it in the shadows, and let the teddy bear picnic be the main attraction.",
